{"id":"a0a1c48294b2e248","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-radical-of-ring.md","title":"Jacobson Radical of a Ring","display":"df-radical-of-ring — Jacobson Radical of a Ring","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-radical-of-ring","aliases":["58-df-radical-of-ring"],"display":"df-radical-of-ring — Jacobson Radical of a Ring","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-radical-of-ring"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-radical-of-ring</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-radical-of-ring — Jacobson Radical of a Ring"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e6a1ed8511f909f2\" href=\"?note=e6a1ed8511f909f2\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md\">../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,+,\\cdot,J\\in V\">\\(R,+,\\cdot,J\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ring}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ring}_S\\)</span> (unital-ring predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Jac}:V^5\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Jac}:V^5\\to V\\)</span> (Jacobson-radical operator with the full ring structure; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e6a1ed8511f909f2\" href=\"?note=e6a1ed8511f909f2\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md\">../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RingRadical}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RingRadical}_S\\)</span> (Jacobson-radical value relation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}radical\\text{-}of\\text{-}ring} \\vdash \\mathrm{RingRadical}_S(J,R,+,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow \\exists 0_R,1_R\\in R\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land J=\\mathrm{Jac}(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}radical\\text{-}of\\text{-}ring} \\vdash \\mathrm{RingRadical}_S(J,R,+,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow \\exists 0_R,1_R\\in R\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land J=\\mathrm{Jac}(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>“Radical” in this atom means specifically the Jacobson radical.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R/\\mathrm{Jac}(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\">\\(R/\\mathrm{Jac}(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\)</span> is semiprimitive in general; it is semisimple Artinian when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> is left Artinian.</li>\n<li>Nilpotent ideals are contained in the Jacobson radical of a unital ring.</li>\n<li>For left Artinian rings, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Jac}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Jac}(R)\\)</span> is nilpotent.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md","status":"resolved","id":"e6a1ed8511f909f2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ring}_S$ (unital-ring predicate; see [[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md","status":"resolved","id":"e6a1ed8511f909f2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Jac}:V^5\\to V$ (Jacobson-radical operator with the full ring structure; see [[../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,+,\\cdot,J\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ring}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Jac}:V^5\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RingRadical}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}radical\\text{-}of\\text{-}ring} \\vdash \\mathrm{RingRadical}_S(J,R,+,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow \\exists 0_R,1_R\\in R\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land J=\\mathrm{Jac}(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"R/\\mathrm{Jac}(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Jac}(R)","display":false}],"bytes":1243,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1029","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-radical-of-ring.md|58-df-radical-of-ring]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["e6a1ed8511f909f2","1c30d21ea7b443f6"]}